WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory-Structure, Edge of the Void, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Kael: It slips. Always.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Collapse is mercy. Let go.

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.200 align:center
Lyra: Never! Got it!

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Structure, Narrow Ledge, urgent.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.800 align:center
Lyra: Chasm! Widening!

8
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.100 align:center
Kael: Jump. Now.

9
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The void welcomes you.

10
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:23.700 align:center
Lyra: Hold tight, blueprint!

11
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Fragmented Memory-Labyrinth Entrance, tense.

12
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.300 align:center
Lyra: Echo Shards! Fast!

13
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.600 align:center
Kael: Labyrinth. Tricky.

14
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.900 align:center
Echo Shard: You cannot hide.

15
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.200 align:center
Lyra: This way!

16
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of Half-Formed Memories, desperate.

17
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.800 align:center
Lyra: Dead end. Trapped.

18
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.100 align:center
Echo Shard: Surrender. Rest.

19
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.400 align:center
Kael: No escape. I remember.

20
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:44.700 align:center
Lyra: Not my end!

21
00:00:45.1000 --> 00:00:49.1000 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth of Half-Formed Memories, Cornered, tense.

22
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.300 align:center
Lyra: This one… Kael.

23
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.600 align:center
Kael: It’s… fading.

24
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:53.900 align:center
Echo Shard: Pointless struggle.

25
00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.200 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me. GO!

26
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.500 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinth, Narrow Crevice, dread.

27
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.800 align:center
Lyra: Protective? How?

28
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.100 align:center
Kael: It believes… it saves.

29
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.400 align:center
Lyra: By devouring us?

30
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.700 align:center
Kael: From the pain… of memory.

31
00:01:07.1000 --> 00:01:10.1000 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Labyrinth, Shifting Corridor, tense.

32
00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:12.300 align:center
Lyra: Blueprint… shifting!

33
00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.600 align:center
Kael: Focus. The core.

34
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:14.900 align:center
Lyra: Sanctuary… coordinates!

35
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You seek the past. We offer future.

36
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Labyrinth, Dissolving Path, dread.

37
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:23.800 align:center
Lyra: Path dissolving! No!

38
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.100 align:center
Kael: Use a shard. Any shard.

39
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.400 align:center
Lyra: My childhood… garden?

40
00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release it. Be free.

41
00:01:29.1000 --> 00:01:30.1000 align:center
Lyra: Goodbye, garden.

42
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:35.300 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Stable Memory-Node, Sanctuary Threshold, tense.

43
00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.600 align:center
Lyra: Almost there! Node!

44
00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:37.900 align:center
Kael: Faster! They know!

45
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your hope is futile.

46
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.500 align:center
Lyra: Not futile! NEVER!

47
00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.800 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Sanctuary Threshold, Central Pedestal, desperate.

48
00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.100 align:center
Lyra: Blueprint… and Kael?

49
00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.400 align:center
Kael: My choice. Remember me.

50
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Stop this. It hurts.

51
00:01:51.1000 --> 00:01:52.1000 align:center
Lyra: I will. Always.

52
00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:58.300 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Sanctuary Threshold, Pedestal Under Attack, dread.

53
00:01:58.600 --> 00:01:59.600 align:center
Lyra: It's working! It's…

54
00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You seek sanctuary. Your father's dream.

55
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.200 align:center
Kael: Lyra… they know.

56
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.500 align:center
Lyra: My father? How?

57
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We know all your dreams. We are you.
